        {
          "sense_id": "Asw:noun:uswa:s1",
          "definition": "An example, model, exemplar, or pattern to be followed.",
          "usage_conditions": "It may refer to a person or thing whose conduct is imitated, whether the example is good or bad; in the Quranic occurrences it denotes a commendable model for imitation.",
