  "cautions": [
    "The Quranic Form I verb is normalized to the classical citation form أَسِيَ, although the supplied Quranic surface forms include تَأْسَ and ءَاسَىٰ.",
    "The noun is presented as أُسْوَةٌ; classical evidence also records the vocalic variant إِسْوَةٌ."
  ],
